00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.750
It's called a compression headache

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.920
from wearing helmets, headbands, hats,

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.890
all of those things that can put

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:02.520
unnecessary pressure on your scalp

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:04.180
can actually cause you a headache.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:05.460
Not to worry though, generally,

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:08.080
when you take those things
