00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.020
maybe if you need to take
something over the counter,

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.590
medication, it will go away.

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:12.840
But the reason this happens is

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:14.700
'cause there's always movement

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.450
between the sutures of your scalp

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.370
and there's always a
little bit of movement.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.340
There's blood flow that needs to happen.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.110
There's a little bit of expansion there

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:24.410
and when you don't let that happen,

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.580
you could actually get a headache

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.690
known as a compression headache.

